WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:03.350
Bananas, potassium, and your blood pressure.

00:03.850 --> 00:11.590
Potassium helps your body get rid of extra salt, and helps your blood vessels relax. Both can lower blood pressure.

00:12.090 --> 00:18.570
Good sources are bananas, tender coconut water, spinach, sweet potato, beans, dal, and curd.

00:19.070 --> 00:25.210
Try to have vegetables or fruit with every meal. Food is the best way to get potassium.

00:25.710 --> 00:38.230
If you have kidney disease, or take certain blood pressure tablets, too much potassium can be harmful. Ask your doctor before taking potassium supplements, or salt substitutes.
